<h1 style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Thank you for attending the Champions for PLAY Golf Outing</h1>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Thank you for attending the 26th Annual Champions for PLAY Golf Outing, benefitting the PLAY Scholarship Fund.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">We greatly appreciate you attending our golf outing after a long hiatus. <a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fmyd8C2TfMRNah27PFdYdKSLZGORoZOs?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="26th Annual Champions for PLAY Photos" rel="noopener" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Please check out photos from the day</a>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">The Champions for PLAY Golf outing was established in 1996 as a charity fundraiser to support our PLAY Scholarship program. Since its inception, the Champions for PLAY Golf Outing has raised over $1 million for youth in Columbus. In 2021, we awarded over 1,700 Columbus youth with grants through our scholarship fund, giving them access to our fee-based programming regardless of their family's ability to pay. Given the increased financial struggles that families continue to face due to the pandemic, we expect the demand for the PLAY grants will continue to grow in 2022 and beyond.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">The PLAY Scholarship fund has been generously supported by community stakeholders, donors, and businesses like you who have championed our belief that children deserve equitable opportunities for enrichment activities through our department. We greatly appreciate your support and hope to see you next year!</p>
<p style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Sincerely, </p>
<p style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">~Bernita </p>
